Description: |
  Lifecycle of goga-tool packages in the current runtime interpreter:
  installation of one, many, or a local source via pip — each successful
  install followed by the tool's optional post-install hook and the shared
  agent re-sync — and removal of one tool via a confirmed forced pip
  uninstall. pip's exit code always propagates unchanged.
